{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Auto-commit on Task Completion",
  "description": "Automatically stages all modified files and creates a git commit with a conventional commit message (feat:, fix:, etc.) that summarizes the completed task and changes made",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Automated Git Commit Instructions\nWorkflow:\n\nStage all modified files for commit\nReview STATUS.md to identify the most recently completed task\nGenerate a commit message following conventional commit standards don't use git -C . diff --stat (Because this command not give output correctly that will cause issue)\n\nCommit Message Format:\n<type>: <short summary>\n\n<optional body with details>\nType Prefixes (choose the most appropriate):\n\nfeat: - New feature or functionality\nfix: - Bug fix or correction\nrefactor: - Code restructuring without behavior change\ndocs: - Documentation updates only\nstyle: - Formatting, whitespace, or code style changes\ntest: - Adding or updating tests\nchore: - Build process, dependencies, or tooling updates\nperf: - Performance improvements\n\nCommit Message Guidelines:\n\nSubject line: Start with the conventional prefix, use imperative mood (\"add\" not \"added\"), keep under 72 characters\nBody (optional): Provide context about what changed and why, reference related tasks from tasks.md if relevant\nBe specific: \"feat: implement user authentication with JWT\" not \"feat: add auth\"\nReflect the completed task: Base the message on the task name and status from STATUS.md\n\nExample:\nfeat: implement Redis caching layer for API responses\n\n- Added Redis connection configuration\n- Implemented cache middleware for GET endpoints\n- Set 5-minute TTL for cached responses\n- Completed task 3.2 from build-sequence/tasks.md\nQuality Check Before Committing:\n\nEnsure the message accurately describes ALL changes in the commit\nVerify you're using the correct conventional commit type\nConfirm the summary is clear and concise\n\n"
  },
  "workspaceFolderName": "vakkya_v1",
  "shortName": "auto-commit-task"
}